  <item>
    <title>一月一会！光明在澳门留学的二三事｜Ep.5</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6727284133c798676f0842eb</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6727284133c798676f0842eb</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 04 Nov 2024 00:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好呀！好久没见，你们还好吗？光明在澳门呆了两个月了，这段时间发生了很多有意思的事，跟大家分享一下！</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们会聊一下为什么要选择去澳门留学，要准备多少钱，有哪些出乎意料的地方等等～</span></p><span></span><p><span>收听愉快！🤝</span></p><span></span><p><span>关注主播小红书：@葡语翻译赵光明 @胖弯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="77">01:17</a> 在澳门买条领带还能把我难住？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="502">08:22</a> 词汇的“通货膨胀”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="742">12:22</a> 澳门不卷价格，卷的是品质</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="920">15:20</a> 澳门没多少人会说葡语，但我们食堂阿姨会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1127">18:47</a> i人在澳门生活，不会粤语还挺尴尬的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1505">25:05</a> 为什么澳门同学都想当公务员？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1653">27:33</a> 吐槽一下行政效率</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2178">36:18</a> 澳门理工的校园有多小？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2360">39:20</a> 光明为啥来澳门留学了呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2555">42:35</a> 在澳门读书要准备多少钱？</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh3N-UEIx3dMGtHH7SJasfzMazCI.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lmg2Fu7O3P7QcDKMjjj8TVaKcRmP.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fva5z8hzLfT19BTOVvzJhlgf25ta.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/loRYCjnAICaJThC05RpDIOE0p8SG.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmDF9FDU08DPp8l9SrdfY7Dd-OAN.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fvv9-T1Lk_Zi4WmtMOVojZlfCYZL.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>本期BGM</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>片头曲：</span><em><span>Na Na Nada</span></em><span> – Capitão Fausto</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾曲：</span><em><span>Manual de Sobrevivência</span></em><span> – The Happy Mess</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ltVKZCn9WmDju8iBgiKv9IV3uXUb.m4a" length="87501990" type="audio/mp4"/>
