    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目是光明和弯弯7月观影影评：《头脑特工队2》《走走停停》《默杀》。</span></p><span></span><p><span>三部电影都有严重剧透哦！介意的朋友请观影后再收听哈～你将会听到治愈焦虑的开始，躺平的中间，愤怒的结尾～</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a> 《头脑特工队2》</span></p><span></span><p><span>皮克斯9年磨一部，抚平东亚小孩的焦虑。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuNFbfS7-fk3Ev4qQmVg3BS21cZO.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1054">17:34</a>《走走停停》</span></p><span></span><p><span>在失望里捡起自己，拍拍灰继续前进。</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWcxLmRvdWJhbmlvLmNvbS92aWV3L3Bob3RvL2wvcHVibGljL3AyOTA3NDI2NDQ5LmpwZw==.jpg"></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1795">29:55</a>《默杀》</span></p><span></span><p><span>别看！听完你就当看过了。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fqi18FQ_OyDWJX26dNQcCUHXmTic.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头曲：</span><em><span>The Life of Riley</span></em><span> – Inside Out 2 (Original Motion Picture Soundtrack)</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾曲：《走走停停》</span><em><span> </span></em><span>（电影《走走停停》原声）</span></p>]]></description>
