  <item>
    <title>六月的桃子、永续的生活和玫瑰的故事｜Ep.2</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/669a266a37236c546e4a6885</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">669a266a37236c546e4a6885</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 19 Jul 2024 08:40:09 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好呀！我们又来跟大家分享我们的生活啦！我们打算把每月回顾做成一个固定栏目，我们会在这个栏目里分享一个月里去过的地方、买过的东西还有看过的书📖影🎬音💿。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期你将听到～～～👇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="90">01:30</a> 弯弯的大理之行：水果敞开吃，却点不到一杯咖啡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="650">10:50</a> 在平潭岛的小房子做两天背包客，体验永续生活：让改变悄悄发生</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq-LBdEFmPr_qfKxNhsrkgJcc5jS.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>践行永续生活的雷雷和比亿：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr9jZxs0UkB2GebBg1Al42tTYM-q.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtL8sXCrVhuAKcPdhVLJX3e9N1qR.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1467">24:27</a> 菌子火锅🍲和手作蛋糕🍰</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsNihSgacvTrHMILgYvK7Krr2Zdn.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1725">28:45</a> 六月买到的小玩意儿</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fryy0PgIV94FGtuUEpqjRGOk4aJ7.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs5Q0vjjUJpLo9gzMODMP3Q7Ppi0.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1998">33:18</a> 《蛤蟆先生去看心理医生》：我妈一口气看了三遍的心理学入门</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhqXbDTvSVO0kFGB-nM-AnRMUzkQ.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2645">44:05</a> 《玫瑰的故事》：刘亦菲的3.5次恋爱换来的自由</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn9c6wXsKT3GGBKLSu5sNP9cKeYq.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>希望我们都能获得幸福💗、好运气🍀，掌控🕹️自己的人生～！</span></p><span></span><figure><br></figure><span></span><h2><span>本期音乐：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>片头：</span><em><span>Dunas</span></em><span> — GNR</span></p><span></span><p><span>插曲：</span><em><span>Something worth saving</span></em><span> — 孟佳（《玫瑰的故事》原声）</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾：</span><em><span>A vida é boa com você</span></em><span> — Bryan Behr</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ltslXWnfCW26XO9PNZ2LrwifQPv8.m4a" length="140901360" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:12:59</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpJvGQqthZIViFLnE7od-VLExtxa.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>狗都不谈的异地恋，我俩要谈第三次？！｜Ep.1</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6687b5bb0bc5d7cc700c7ca9</link>
